{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8aad6006945d2809f74","chatId":"350a5241da074ff1aa31158207df71ec","sessionId":null,"userId":68264,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":994,"promptTokens":1480,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:46"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006690324264327307,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8aad6006945d2809f73","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369706026,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:46","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8aad6006945d2809f73","chatId":"350a5241da074ff1aa31158207df71ec","sessionId":null,"userId":68264,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n安娜是一位自学成才的艺术家，而她的妹妹伊莉从小就上艺术课。伊莉经常因为安娜缺乏创造力而批评她。有一天，伊莉参加了一场备受推崇的摄影比赛，却输了。然后她发现安娜以她的艺术作品赢得了同一比赛。于是，她上网发表评论，声称评审们不懂艺术。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，安娜最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 自豪\nB) 愧疚\nC) 嫉妒\nD) 感激\nE) 绝望\nF) 钦佩\n\n## 问题 2\n安娜为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 赢得摄影比赛让安娜感到自豪\nB) 安娜收到了她的姐姐的好评\nC) 安娜在网上的争论中取得了胜利\nD) 安娜终于拍下了她喜欢的照片","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006690324264327307,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8aad6006945d2809f74","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369706024,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:46","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"76e168faead34ca5bc0e6e01afde94df"}